I.K.E. Windows engine: AAC through the decoder of Windows

Chromium's MediaFoundationAudioDecoder takes every AAC profile, not only
xHE-AAC; two fixes from later Chromium versions; AAC from a plain MP4 file
gets a sample format although FFmpeg has no AAC decoder.

